{"id":"n66572-2-7","stage":1,"title":"얼다 · 冻僵","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n66572-2-7-1","ko":"왜 이렇게 부들부들 떨어? 추워?","zh":"怎么抖得这么厉害？冷吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"왜","meaning":"为什么","explanation":"왜：为什么","readings":[{"term":"왜","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67848","senseId":"1","lemma":"왜","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"이렇게","meaning":"这样","explanation":"이렇다：这样；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"이렇다","audio":"/audio/c2f95cfd19c5a89b2cd1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71157","senseId":"1","lemma":"이렇다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"부들부들","meaning":"哆哆嗦嗦地","explanation":"부들부들：哆哆嗦嗦地","readings":[{"term":"부들부들","audio":"/audio/c7f1d6c833c9ce10b1bc.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"59380","senseId":"1","lemma":"부들부들","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"떨어?","meaning":"颤抖，打冷战，发抖","explanation":"떨다：颤抖，打冷战，发抖；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"떨다","audio":"/audio/c05578fd2da67674b9a9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"65529","senseId":"3","lemma":"떨다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"추워?","meaning":"冷","explanation":"춥다：冷；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"춥다","audio":"/audio/7c651efb56d12a6540a4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72146","senseId":"1","lemma":"춥다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"08b35eb63efd4aaa","term":"왜","zh":"为什么","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3","entryId":"67848","definition":"因什么原因；或指怎么。","pronunciation":["왜ː"]},{"id":"c2f95cfd19c5a89b","term":"이렇다","zh":"这样","audio":"/audio/c2f95cfd19c5a89b2cd1.mp3","entryId":"71157","definition":"表示状态、样子、性质等与此相同。","pronunciation":["이러타"]},{"id":"c7f1d6c833c9ce10","term":"부들부들","zh":"哆哆嗦嗦地","audio":"/audio/c7f1d6c833c9ce10b1bc.mp3","entryId":"59380","definition":"因寒冷、害怕、生气，一直把身体颤抖得厉害的样子。","pronunciation":["부들부들"]},{"id":"c05578fd2da67674","term":"떨다","zh":"颤抖，打冷战，发抖","audio":"/audio/c05578fd2da67674b9a9.mp3","entryId":"65529","definition":"非常冷或害怕。","pronunciation":["떨ː다"]},{"id":"7c651efb56d12a65","term":"춥다","zh":"冷","audio":"/audio/7c651efb56d12a6540a4.mp3","entryId":"72146","definition":"身体感觉到的气温低。","pronunciation":["춥따"]}],"audio":"/audio/df62afa25048f0d32b59.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n66572-2-7-2","ko":"응. 손끝이랑 발이 다 얼었어.","zh":"嗯，手指和脚都冻僵了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"응.","meaning":"是，行","explanation":"응：是，行","readings":[{"term":"응","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30205","senseId":"2","lemma":"응","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"손끝이랑","meaning":"手指尖","explanation":"손끝：手指尖；이랑：连接并列名词，表示“和”。","readings":[{"term":"손끝","audio":"/audio/73918ab067122ae9639b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"63930","senseId":"1","lemma":"손끝","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"발이","meaning":"足，脚","explanation":"발：足，脚；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"발","audio":"/audio/45a4bd47fdb2ffcdd952.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67886","senseId":"1","lemma":"발","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"다","meaning":"全，都","explanation":"다：全，都","readings":[{"term":"다","audio":"/audio/822b7db6f6886f572413.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58175","senseId":"1","lemma":"다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"얼었어.","meaning":"冻僵","explanation":"얼다：冻僵；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"얼다","audio":"/audio/483a31bad3d8768e32a5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66572","senseId":"2","lemma":"얼다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"107dd01c3d38a368","term":"응","zh":"是，行","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3","entryId":"30205","definition":"用于肯定回答对方所提出的问题或命令等。","pronunciation":["응"]},{"id":"73918ab067122ae9","term":"손끝","zh":"手指尖","audio":"/audio/73918ab067122ae9639b.mp3","entryId":"63930","definition":"手指的顶端。","pronunciation":["손끋"]},{"id":"45a4bd47fdb2ffcd","term":"발